@base = http://localhost:8083

### Listar todos os voos
GET {{base}}/voos

### Buscar com filtros (deve trazer só o AE1001)
GET {{base}}/voos?origem=FOR&destino=GRU&data=2026-12-15

### Detalhe de um voo
GET {{base}}/voos/1

### Voo inexistente (deve dar 404)
GET {{base}}/voos/999

### Cadastrar voo (deve dar 201)
POST {{base}}/voos
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "codigo": "AE3001",
  "origem": "FOR",
  "destino": "SSA",
  "dataPartida": "2026-12-18T07:00:00",
  "dataChegada": "2026-12-18T08:40:00",
  "preco": 420.00,
  "totalAssentos": 100
}

### Cadastro inválido (deve dar 400)
POST {{base}}/voos
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "codigo": "X1",
  "origem": "FOR",
  "destino": "FOR",
  "dataPartida": "2026-12-18T07:00:00",
  "dataChegada": "2026-12-18T06:00:00",
  "preco": 100,
  "totalAssentos": 10
}

### Reservar assento (assentosDisponiveis diminui 1)
POST {{base}}/voos/1/reservar-assento

### Liberar assento (assentosDisponiveis volta)
POST {{base}}/voos/1/liberar-assento